<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32866" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκσείω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>shake out</i> or <i>off,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς κεφαλῆς ἐ. [τὸ δέρμα]</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.64
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τὴν ἐσθῆτα</span>
			<i>shake out</i> one's clothes, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				79
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκσέσεισται χαμᾶζ</span>
			(sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ τρίβων</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				344
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				7.624
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>drive out</i> or <i>forth,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν λογισμῶν ἐ. τινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					14
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τὴν ἀπολογίαν</span>
			<i>reject</i> it, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				18.66
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
